{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "d78a1f6e9eaad7e81748e5b52333cfd40353b7c2e19f8b3d20b90dc5b68fbd3e", "ja": "占いといえば…\nこの前あずささんが、\nみんなのことを占ってたっけ。", "zh": "说到占卜……\n前些日子，梓小姐还给大家算过来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
